msgstr "Preispläne"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:279
#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:284
msgid "Manage Pricing Plans"
msgstr "Preispläne verwalten"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:281
msgid ""
"Bundle credits + listing limits into named plans assigned at submission time."
msgstr ""
"Bündle Credits und Listing-Limits in benannten Plänen, die bei der "
