#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1242
msgid "Owner Replies"
msgstr "Antworten des Eigentümers"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1243
msgid ""
"Whether listing owners can publicly respond to reviews left on their "
"listings."
msgstr ""
"Ob Listing-Eigentümer öffentlich auf Reviews antworten können, die zu ihren "
"Listings hinterlassen wurden."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1248
msgid "Enable replies"
msgstr "Antworten aktivieren"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1253
msgid "Allow listing owners to publicly reply to reviews"
msgstr "Erlaube Listing-Eigentümern, öffentlich auf Reviews zu antworten"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1255
msgid ""
